  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoListParagraph&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;The proposed development, by reason of the proposed\r\nsubdivision of the rear garden into four separate amenity spaces would, taking\r\ninto account the size of the plot, result in a form of development which would\r\nbe at odds with the prevailing character and appearance and spatial grain of\r\nthe area. The subdivision would erode the spaciousness and verdant quality of\r\nthe plot and the plethora of boundary fencing would create an awkward\r\ncompartmentalisation and fragmentation of the garden, resulting in cramped,\r\ncontrived, poor amenity areas for future occupiers.&amp;nbsp; The proposed development is contrary to\r\nPolicies GR1 and HO2(g) of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
